---
/* L61 - the same content in three shapes. One writer: the figures workstream C. */
---

<figure class="fig">
  <div class="fig__frame">
    <img
      class="fig__picture"
      src={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}illustrations/L61.jpg`}
      alt="A line drawing of three encodings of one message sending arrows to a probability scale, with two dots above a dashed 0.5 line and one prussian dot below it."
    />
    <svg
      class="fig__svg"
      viewBox="0 0 640 340"
      role="img"
      aria-labelledby="L61-fig-title L61-fig-desc"
    >
      <title id="L61-fig-title">The same content in three shapes, and one decision that flips</title>
      <desc id="L61-fig-desc">
        On the left, three small drawings of the same content: a wavy line for the prose version, two flat rules for the flat version, and a dashed box inside a box for the nested version. Three arrows run right to a vertical probability scale. On the scale, two dots sit high, at 0.90 and 0.86, above a dashed 0.5 line, and one prussian dot sits low at 0.09, below that line. The arrows draw themselves in turn and the low dot pulses.
      </desc>
      <defs>
        <marker id="L61-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
          <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" fill="var(--color-ink-45)" />
        </marker>
      </defs>

      <rect x="40" y="70" width="140" height="52" fill="var(--color-ground)" stroke="var(--color-rule)" stroke-width="1" />
      <path d="M 54 88 C 70 82 88 96 106 88 C 120 82 132 94 166 88" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-ink-45)" stroke-width="1" />
      <text x="40" y="138" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="11" fill="var(--color-ink-70)">prose</text>

      <rect x="40" y="156" width="140" height="52" fill="var(--color-ground)" stroke="var(--color-rule)" stroke-width="1" />
      <line x1="54" y1="174" x2="166" y2="174" stroke="var(--color-ink-45)" stroke-width="1" />
      <line x1="54" y1="192" x2="166" y2="192" stroke="var(--color-ink-45)" stroke-width="1" />
      <text x="40" y="224" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="11" fill="var(--color-ink-70)">flat</text>

      <rect x="40" y="242" width="140" height="52" fill="var(--color-ground)" stroke="var(--color-rule)" stroke-width="1" />
      <rect x="72" y="256" width="76" height="24" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-ink-45)" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="4 3" />
      <text x="40" y="310" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="11" fill="var(--color-ink-70)">nested</text>

      <line x1="500" y1="280" x2="500" y2="56" stroke="var(--color-ink-45)" stroke-width="1" />
      <line x1="470" y1="168" x2="530" y2="168" stroke="var(--color-prussian)" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="5 4" />
      <text x="536" y="172" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="11" fill="var(--color-prussian)">0.5</text>

      <path class="m-draw" style="--m-length: 330; --m-duration: 1.1s;" d="M 180 96 L 480 96 L 480 82 L 494 82" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-ink-45)" stroke-width="1" marker-end="url(#L61-arrow)" />
      <path class="m-draw" style="--m-length: 330; --m-duration: 1.1s; --m-delay: 0.3s;" d="M 180 182 L 460 182 L 460 92 L 494 92" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-ink-45)" stroke-width="1" marker-end="url(#L61-arrow)" />
      <path class="m-draw" style="--m-length: 330; --m-duration: 1.1s; --m-delay: 0.6s;" d="M 180 268 L 440 268 L 440 258 L 494 258" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-ink-45)" stroke-width="1" marker-end="url(#L61-arrow)" />

      <circle cx="500" cy="82" r="5" fill="var(--color-ink)" />
      <text x="512" y="86" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="11" fill="var(--color-ink-70)">0.90</text>
      <circle cx="500" cy="92" r="5" fill="var(--color-ink)" />
      <text x="512" y="106" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="11" fill="var(--color-ink-70)">0.86</text>
      <circle class="m-pulse" style="--m-duration: 1.1s; --m-delay: 1s;" cx="500" cy="258" r="6" fill="var(--color-prussian)" />
      <text class="m-pulse" style="--m-duration: 1.1s; --m-delay: 1s;" x="512" y="262" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="11" fill="var(--color-prussian)">0.09</text>

      <text x="200" y="140" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="10" fill="var(--color-ink-45)">the same content, three shapes</text>
      <text x="40" y="332" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="10" fill="var(--color-ink-45)">only the crossing counts: a probability that moves without flipping changed no decision</text>

    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption class="fig__caption">
    <span class="edge-code">figure L61</span>
    <span class="fig__caption-text">The same ticket in three serialisations moves the probability from 0.90 to 0.09, and only the one that crosses the 0.5 line changes a decision.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  /* scoped to this figure */
  .fig__svg {
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
</style>
